flowchart TD
    Start([需要共享状态的命令]) --> Lock[Acquire 全局 APM 锁]
    Lock --> Inspect[Inspect 唯一 transactions/active.json]
    Inspect -->|无 journal| Resume[继续当前命令]
    Inspect -->|schema v1 shared envelope| Driver{driver}
    Driver -->|filesystem| FS[filesystem Skill 恢复]
    Driver -->|agent-cli| CLI[按 journal Agent ResolveMCP]
    Driver -->|plugin| Plugin[按 journal Agent ResolvePlugin]
    FS --> Converge[按持久化 phase 提交或回滚]
    CLI --> InspectMCP[Agent CLI Inspect 同名 MCP]
    InspectMCP --> Converge
    Plugin --> InspectPlugin[Adapter Inspect 实际名 / 受控文件路径]
    InspectPlugin --> Converge
    Converge --> Delete[收敛后删除同一个 journal]
    Delete --> Warn[锁内同步恢复 Warn]
    Warn --> Resume
    Inspect -->|其他格式或非法 driver/payload| Fail[ErrInvalidJournal；原样保留 journal]
    InspectMCP -->|CLI/输出不确定| Fail
    InspectPlugin -->|CLI/路径不确定| Fail
    Converge -->|失败或不确定| Fail
    Fail --> Release[Release 并阻止当前业务]
